{{#with booking}}
<p>Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}{{customer_name}}{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p>This is a friendly reminder about your Tanzania safari quote request with <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong>.</p>

<div class="divider"></div>

<div class="data-card">
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Package</span>
    <span class="value">{{package_name}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Travel Date</span>
    <span class="value">{{#if start_date}}{{formatDate start_date}}{{else}}{{travel_date}}{{/if}}</span>
  </div>
  {{#if days_until}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Reminder stage</span>
    <span class="value">{{days_until}}h follow-up (within 24 hours of your request)</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p>Our Team in Arusha is preparing your itinerary. No payment is taken online — after you accept the quote we send offline deposit instructions.</p>

<p>Questions? Reply to this email or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/255695108009">+255 695 108 009</a>.</p>

<p><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">WhatsApp Our Team</a></p>
{{/with}}
